"All this is said, and yet not spoken at all;
But deep within, in some secret chamber of his soul,
He thought aloud as he spoke these words, "There goes a ghost!"

"To some extent they must find out for themselves;
And if you do your best you may get along,
But unless you go beyond yourself you'll never rise above yourself—-

Now earth becomes a shrine for Heaven's repose,
And angels from their spheres through every soul pass ;
From Nature they have risen and left her powers ;
She sleeps, while God within her reigns, and pours
New life into creation, which we know
To be an image of His work below;
For He creates us after His own form
By means of man, who makes another Him.
